      "path": "robots.txt",
      "content": "# Robots.txt for WTFun (whatthefun.wtf)\n# Allow all major search engine crawlers to access the site\n\nUser-agent: *\nAllow: /\nAllow: /item/\nAllow: /start-a-plan.html\n\n# Sitemap location\nSitemap: https://whatthefun.wtf/sitemap.xml\n\n# Allow Google to crawl all content\nUser-agent: Googlebot\nAllow: /\n\n# Allow Google Merchant Center / Shopping bots\nUser-agent: Googlebot-Image\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: Mediapartners-Google\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: AdsBot-Google\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: AdsBot-Google-Mobile\nAllow: /\n\n# Allow Bing\nUser-agent: Bingbot\nAllow: /\n\n# Social media crawlers for rich previews\nUser-agent: facebookexternalhit\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: Twitterbot\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: LinkedInBot\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: WhatsApp\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: Discordbot\nAllow: /\n\n# Disallow crawling of internal/admin pages\nUser-agent: *\nDisallow: /crm.html\nDisallow: /crm-login.html\nDisallow: /dashboard.html\nDisallow: /store-dashboard.html\nDisallow: /diagnostic-likes.html\nDisallow: /test-calendar-export.html\nDisallow: /.netlify/\nDisallow: /teammate.html\nDisallow: /invitee.html\nDisallow: /itinerary.html\n\n# Allow access to API endpoints that provide public data\nAllow: /api/merchant-feed\nAllow: /sitemap.xml\nAllow: /merchant-feed.xml\n"
